    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Interface to the direct PARDISO solver from the MKL library. Derived from <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_solver" kindref="compound">Solver</ref> class, following CSMP&apos;s strategy design pattern for the solution of linear algebraic systems of equations.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>works only if there is access to the MKL library.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>draft SKM </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>30/7/2019 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
